WEBVTT

46:25.667 --> 46:27.084
That's sudden.

46:27.167 --> 46:29.042
Yeah, I know.
They informed me last minute.

46:29.167 --> 46:30.334
I have to leave early in the morning.

46:30.667 --> 46:32.792
I have a lot of packing to do. Bye, Dad.

46:32.959 --> 46:33.834
Alright.

46:34.209 --> 46:35.084
Take care.
